(850,1,'2026-05-10 19:11:51','2026-05-10 19:11:51','<h2>আপনার সন্তানের কোডিং যাত্রা শুরু হোক এখানে!</h2>		<p>Empowering kids with coding and interactive eBooks.</p>								<a href=\"#\">\n									Start Course\n					</a>\n														<a href=\"#\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 192 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M0 384.662V127.338c0-17.818 21.543-26.741 34.142-14.142l128.662 128.662c7.81 7.81 7.81 20.474 0 28.284L34.142 398.804C21.543 411.404 0 402.48 0 384.662z\"></path></svg>			\n									All Courses\n					</a>\n											<h4 \n		data-interaction-id=\"0466493\" \n		class=\"e-0466493-0abf7ae e-heading-base\" \n	>\n			ই-বুকটি সংগ্রহ করলেই আপনি পাচ্ছেন <strong id=\"e-mp1ku5ut-b1i8tpb\">১০,০০০</strong> <strong id=\"e-mp1ku5ut-lc08n5f\">টাকা মূল্যের পূর্ণাঙ্গ ভিডিও কোর্স একদম ফ্রি!</strong>\n		</h4>\n							<h5 \n		data-interaction-id=\"1d3a7ec\" \n		class=\"e-1d3a7ec-8027c68 e-heading-base\" \n	>\n			<strong id=\"e-mp1gh0tn-6xk7pqg\">এই বান্ডেলে যা যা থাকছে:</strong><br>\n		</h5>\n							<ul>\n							<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504 256c0 136.967-111.033 248-248 248S8 392.967 8 256 119.033 8 256 8s248 111.033 248 248zM227.314 387.314l184-184c6.248-6.248 6.248-16.379 0-22.627l-22.627-22.627c-6.248-6.249-16.379-6.249-22.628 0L216 308.118l-70.059-70.059c-6.248-6.248-16.379-6.248-22.628 0l-22.627 22.627c-6.248 6.248-6.248 16.379 0 22.627l104 104c6.249 6.249 16.379 6.249 22.628.001z\"></path></svg>						\n										সহজ বাংলা ই-বুক।\n									</li>\n								<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504 256c0 136.967-111.033 248-248 248S8 392.967 8 256 119.033 8 256 8s248 111.033 248 248zM227.314 387.314l184-184c6.248-6.248 6.248-16.379 0-22.627l-22.627-22.627c-6.248-6.249-16.379-6.249-22.628 0L216 308.118l-70.059-70.059c-6.248-6.248-16.379-6.248-22.628 0l-22.627 22.627c-6.248 6.248-6.24